// IntelliJ IDEA / Cursor / WebStorm — secrets and session values for HTTP Client (.http in this folder).
//
// Usage:
//   1. cp http-client.private.env.json.example http-client.private.env.json
//   2. Fill placeholders (file is gitignored — do not commit).
//   3. With http-client.env.json and environment **sample** or **dev** in the IDE gutter.
//
// --- dev (rest-client/Sample.Api.http) ---
// LAST_CODE — from Register / RequestCode / ForgotPassword response (DeveloperMode).
// REFRESH_TOKEN — from Token / TokenByCode response (refresh_token field).

{
  "dev": {
    "LAST_CODE": "<paste LastCode from Register>",
    "REFRESH_TOKEN": "<paste refresh_token from Token>"
  },
}
